{"id":"vod_md_4333","vodId":"4333","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"JOJO的奇妙冒险 不灭钻石","name_cn":"JOJO的奇妙冒险 不灭钻石","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"39集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230906-1/800eeefce2690a63216f0ac703508c3d.jpg"},"summary":"为了寻找外公乔瑟夫的私生子，空条承太郎（小野大辅 配音）来到了杜王町，名为东方仗助（小野友树 配音）的高中一年级男生正是空条承太郎要寻找的人，让承太郎没有想到的是，东方仗助拥有着和自己一样的“替身”能力。身材矮小但拥有强大意志力的广濑康一（梶裕贵 配音），大脑一根筋但对待朋友忠诚不二的虹村亿泰（高木涉 配音），自大而又偏执的人气漫画家岸边露伴（樱井孝宏 配音），围绕在东方仗助身边的，是这些有趣而又强大的朋友和队友们，与此同时，越来越多的替身使者亦接连浮出水面。当罪恶的魔爪伸向杜王町之时，东方仗助愿意以自己的生命为代价，保护这片他热爱的土地。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-06 08:22:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":39,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/7uBMfPWV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/LX6LKOVg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/f7UVsie3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/DYcp7rns/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/riddmJZY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/7UN01jux/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230904/ndM6QuTn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/eiNgFvzF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/sskAlvgk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/CtlG0Lst/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/AcMqx9Ao/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/i69rC885/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/ZUTxvspL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/RiQCU1MF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230905/4fn2T1PF/index.m3u8"},{"na